   6:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *          This file provides firmware functions to manage the following 
   7:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *          functionalities of the Reset and Clock Control (RCC) peripheral:
   8:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *           + Initialization and de-initialization functions
   9:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *           + Peripheral Control functions
  10:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *       
  11:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   @verbatim                
  12:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   ==============================================================================
  13:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****                       ##### RCC specific features #####
  14:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   ==============================================================================
  15:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****     [..]  
  16:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****       After reset the device is running from Internal High Speed oscillator
  17:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****       (HSI 8MHz) with Flash 0 wait state, Flash prefetch buffer is enabled, 
  18:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****       and all peripherals are off except internal SRAM, Flash and JTAG.
  19:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****       (+) There is no prescaler on High speed (AHB) and Low speed (APB) buses;
  20:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****           all peripherals mapped on these buses are running at HSI speed.
  21:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****       (+) The clock for all peripherals is switched off, except the SRAM and FLASH.
  22:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****       (+) All GPIOs are in input floating state, except the JTAG pins which
  23:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****           are assigned to be used for debug purpose.
  24:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****     [..] Once the device started from reset, the user application has to:
  25:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****       (+) Configure the clock source to be used to drive the System clock
  26:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****           (if the application needs higher frequency/performance)
  27:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****       (+) Configure the System clock frequency and Flash settings  
  28:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****       (+) Configure the AHB and APB buses prescalers
  29:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****       (+) Enable the clock for the peripheral(s) to be used
  30:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****       (+) Configure the clock source(s) for peripherals whose clocks are not
ARM GAS  /tmp/cccxcDip.s 			page 2


  31:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****           derived from the System clock (RTC, ADC, I2C, I2S, TIM, USB FS)
  32:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c **** 
  33:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****                       ##### RCC Limitations #####
  34:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   ==============================================================================
  35:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****     [..]  
  36:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****       A delay between an RCC peripheral clock enable and the effective peripheral 
  37:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****       enabling should be taken into account in order to manage the peripheral read/write 
  38:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****       from/to registers.
  39:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****       (+) This delay depends on the peripheral mapping.
  40:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****         (++) AHB & APB peripherals, 1 dummy read is necessary
  41:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c **** 
  42:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****     [..]  
  43:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****       Workarounds:
  44:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****       (#) For AHB & APB peripherals, a dummy read to the peripheral register has been
  45:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****           inserted in each __HAL_RCC_PPP_CLK_ENABLE() macro.
  46:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c **** 
  47:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   @endverbatim
