 937:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c **** /**
 938:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @brief  Returns the SYSCLK frequency     
 939:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @note   The system frequency computed by this function is not the real 
 940:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *         frequency in the chip. It is calculated based on the predefined 
 941:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *         constant and the selected clock source:
 942:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @note     If SYSCLK source is HSI, function returns values based on HSI_VALUE(*)
 943:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @note     If SYSCLK source is HSE, function returns a value based on HSE_VALUE
 944:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *           divided by PREDIV factor(**)
 945:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @note     If SYSCLK source is PLL, function returns a value based on HSE_VALUE
 946:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *           divided by PREDIV factor(**) or HSI_VALUE(*) multiplied by the PLL factor.
 947:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @note     (*) HSI_VALUE is a constant defined in stm32f3xx_hal_conf.h file (default value
 948:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *               8 MHz) but the real value may vary depending on the variations
 949:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *               in voltage and temperature.
 950:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @note     (**) HSE_VALUE is a constant defined in stm32f3xx_hal_conf.h file (default value
 951:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *                8 MHz), user has to ensure that HSE_VALUE is same as the real
 952:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *                frequency of the crystal used. Otherwise, this function may
 953:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *                have wrong result.
 954:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *                  
 955:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @note   The result of this function could be not correct when using fractional
 956:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *         value for HSE crystal.
 957:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *           
 958:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @note   This function can be used by the user application to compute the 
 959:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *         baud-rate for the communication peripherals or configure other parameters.
 960:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *           
 961:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @note   Each time SYSCLK changes, this function must be called to update the
 962:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *         right SYSCLK value. Otherwise, any configuration based on this function will be incorre
